"""Standalone, vendorable Castiron generated-content hashing and reporting.

Hash v1: SHA256(domain || u64(entry count) || entries), where each entry is
u64(path length) || path bytes || six ASCII Git mode bytes || u64(blob length)
|| blob bytes. Integers are unsigned big-endian. Entries sort by raw Git path.
Only .github/actions/ and .github/workflows/ are excluded. No SDK imports.
"""

